182400","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3256100","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:56Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3256100,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":"KRW","divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":true,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":true,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3256100","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:56Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3256100,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-3256100","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:56Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":3256100,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1847286114028625","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"A cowboy tried the EdNoKa demo","summary":"Jissouille, a creator on TikTok, sat down with the demo in his best cowboy voice. Pico Golf, a few quiz rounds, and some strong opinions about an octopus. He calls it harder than Elden Ring. The quizzes are for ages 8 to 11. The demo is free on Steam. If your kid does better than the cowboy, tell us in the discussions.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:07:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028625","verified_at":"2026-10-21T16:29:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1846651706692083","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest is on. The EdNoKa demo is free.","summary":"Next Fest is on until October 26, so this is basically the week to try EdNoKa. Pick a quiz, pick a game. Answer right and it rains on your crops, your golf ball gets an extra stroke, fewer missiles chase you. Answer wrong and nothing ends. The missiles just get a bit more motivated. It plays in English or French, no chat, no ads. A recording of our family playing it runs on the store page all week, if you want to see it first. If your kid tries it, tell us what they thought in the discussions. W","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:12:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1846651706681645","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch our family play EdNoKa (recorded) all Next Fest","summary":"During Next Fest this page plays a recording of our son going through the EdNoKa demo. It's recorded, not live. If you miss a good answer, just wait, it comes back. He does multiplication while dodging missiles, world flags on the golf course, dinosaurs, then switches the whole game to French and keeps going. The camera only shows his hands on the keyboard. The demo is free on this page, for ages 8 to 11. Questions? Ask in the discussions, we answer every post.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T14:13:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706681645","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1846018067942398","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"The EdNoKa demo now speaks French","summary":"Basically, the free demo is now in French. Menus, games, the demo quizzes, all of it. To switch, click the globe icon on the main menu. We live in Montreal and our son goes to school in French, so I figured it was time. While translating I learned that a manchot and a pingouin are not the same bird. The game knew before me. The rest of the quizzes get their French for the full release on December 17. If a sentence sounds weird in French, tell us in the discussions. Enjoy! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/4533","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T22:29:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942398","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1846018067925983","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"Meet the Parent Hub","summary":"Ever ask your kid \"how was the game?\" and get \"good\"? Same here. That's why we made the Parent Hub. The Parent Hub It shows which quizzes got played and how they went. It's right there on the same computer, no extra account, nothing sent anywhere. No timers, no nagging, no comparing kids. It's in the full game (no DLC needed), so it's ready the moment you install. We're in Steam Next Fest, October 19 to 26 if you want to check out the demo too. Tell us on Discord what you'd want a Parent Hub to ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T12:47:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067925983","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1844115010504030","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"Five games, five different ways a right answer pays off","summary":"The demo has been out two weeks, so here is what is actually in it. All five games are in the demo, not a sample of them. What changes between them is what a correct answer buys you. Veggies Island. Gather, trade for seeds, grow your patch. Correct answers make it rain, and rain is what grows the crop. Pico Golf. Underwater mini golf across ten holes. Correct answers earn you extra strokes, so a good round of questions is a good round of golf. Agent Ka. A detective hunt through the city, with po","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-22T12:15:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010504030","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3256100-1842846814451573","game_id":"steam-3256100","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out. Go play it.","summary":"We pressed the button. The EdNoKa demo is live on Steam, it is free, and the download button is right on this page. What it is Five mini-games where the quiz is part of the play, not a screen that interrupts it. Farm, golf, investigate, fight or fly your way through a set of questions. Answer right and your crop grows, your shot lands, your cover holds. The questions are written for grades 3 to 5, across math, science, social studies and language. 36 quizzes, 3,600 questions in the full game, re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T19:45:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451573","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:06:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3256100":